{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_45_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_45","textTraditional":"一、十有六年，春，王正月。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_45_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_45","textTraditional":"二、夏，宋人、齊人、衞人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_45_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_45","textTraditional":"三、秋，荊伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_45_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_45","textTraditional":"四、冬，十有二月，會齊侯、宋公、陳侯、衞侯、鄭伯、許男、曹伯、滑伯、滕子，同盟於幽。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_45_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_45","textTraditional":"同者，有同也，同尊周也。不言公，外內寮一，疑之也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_45_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_45","textTraditional":"五、邾子克卒。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_45_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_45","textTraditional":"其曰子，進之也。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}